     A*
     A* Claim Restriction User Access Control File
     A*
     A* DESCRIPTION: Users will have access blocked to claims for any
     A*              record in this file that matches any claim with
     A*              access being attempted.
     A*
     A* 04/08/05  C: 132  Project: 114WIH
     A*
      *****************************************************************
      * REVISIONS:                                                    *
      *                                                               *
      *****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PXR01                     TEXT('CLAIMS RESTRICTION FILE')
     A            XRCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            XRUSID    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      TEXT('Restrict Access User ID')
     A            XRFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            XRFYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A            XRCASE    R               REFFLD(CASE)
     A                                      TEXT('Restrict Access Case #')
     A                                      COLHDG('Case #')
     A            XRSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            XRUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            XRPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            XRTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            XRDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
     A            XRIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'USER')
     A            XRIPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'PROGRAM')
     A            XRITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'TIME')
     A            XRIDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'DATE')
